  id: Desert_Cabin_3
  headerName: "House Notes \u2014 3"
  content: "\tDon't look down too long. The sand here falls constantly over the edge.
    If you let your gaze follow it down, your mind follows too \u2014 all the way
    into the darkness below. We've learned to look at the horizon instead."
